I hope you continue drawing the work about the pretty Kagiyama hina from Touhou project.\nThis time, I hope hina have large-breasts and wear stockings.\nAll the other details could be as you like.\nThank you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@garasuno_1182/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f2155b8/uploads/origins/435d8fa7-a2c6-4528-b055-37128232c9ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=573a443986521063d50e3c5f7867e7b9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2f2155b8/uploads/origins/435d8fa7-a2c6-4528-b055-37128232c9ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=573a443986521063d50e3c5f7867e7b9, https://si.imgix.net/2f2155b8/uploads/origins/435d8fa7-a2c6-4528-b055-37128232c9ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81b3c20e11fad58793e6213a7fc2b5b7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2f2155b8/uploads/origins/435d8fa7-a2c6-4528-b055-37128232c9ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e79806182139ab44ab86662d5751b2ed 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "お初にお目にかかります。\nイラストのリクエストをさせて頂きますので、ご検討の程を宜しくお願い致します。\n\n・『東方虹龍洞』の「山城たかね」をお願いしたいです。\n　もし可能であれば「半袖＋黒い長手袋」の衣装アレンジをお願い申し上げます。\n\n・衣装アレンジのイメージ図として、以下をご参考頂いてもOKです。\n\n当方が過去にリクエストして納品頂いた作品群（抜粋）\nhttps://skeb.jp/@e_sdss/works/1\nhttps://skeb.jp/@h_cheep/works/12\nhttps://skeb.jp/@monokuromanga/works/7\n\n当方の過去イラスト\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/102740127\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/110744031", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@garasuno_1182/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9bc31c81/uploads/origins/6a74eec6-e7f2-45d8-9641-cf1513a493eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9ec64833cd06d3f55663bdf82ac8a50a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9bc31c81/uploads/origins/6a74eec6-e7f2-4